    title: 'Supervised Machine Learning', eyebrow: 'ML COURSE 1 • ANSWER KEY KE SAATH PADHAI',
    intro: 'Computer ko solved examples dikha ke sikhana — jaise exam se pehle solved papers. Number predict karna (regression) aur category chunna (classification), cost function, gradient descent, overfitting aur regularization.',
