    intro: 'Logistic regression ki team = neural network. Phir TensorFlow, activations, softmax, backprop — aur asli ML engineering: train/CV/test, bias-variance, error analysis, precision-recall. Aakhir mein decision trees, random forest aur XGBoost.',
    path: ['Neurons ki team', 'Train (backprop)', 'Check (train/CV/test)', 'Diagnose (bias/variance)', 'Trees bhi try karo'],
